   "text": "What if they say no?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.5,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg18",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then ask about other things, like an earlier pay review, extra holiday, or a training budget.",
